* macros to send open&cose then move cursor left one to type inside
  * https://docs.qmk.fm/feature_macros
  * https://docs.qmk.fm/features/send_string#examples
  * ctl+[  ->  [] + move cursor one left
  * ctl+]  ->  {} + move cursor one left
  * ctl+)  ->  () + move cursor one left (set pinky right shift to SC_RCPC)


* set the exact rgb animation
	* see keyboard.json
